  "brendan-allen-christian-leroy-duncan": {
   "summary": "Duncan was the sharper striker for most of the fight, rocking Allen with a spinning elbow in round 1 and out-jabbing a slowing Allen in round 4. Allen's wrestling kept him in it: a takedown and heavy ground-and-pound won round 2 (Duncan was also docked a point for an eye poke), and round 3 was a grappling grind. Early in round 5 Allen dragged Duncan down from a bodylock, took his back and choked him out at 2:46.",
   "turning_point": "Round 5: Allen's bodylock takedown to the back. Sherdog's scorers had Duncan narrowly ahead going into it, MMA Mania had Allen.",
